# ECC Plugin Adapter

ECC is available in this repo as a Cursor plugin at `plugins/ecc/`.

- Load ECC skills/agents/commands when the task is engineering process (TDD, review, security, verification).
- Keep career, JD, resume, and PLM work on hub rules and hub skills.
- Do not copy ECC always-on rules or hooks into `.cursor/rules/` or `.cursor/hooks.json`.
- Refresh with `bash scripts/install-ecc-cursor-plugin.sh`.
